## Lore

Blood Lizards are fast, powerful D-Bee predators that look like bipedal
dinosaurs but are far quicker and stronger than any carnosaur, and far smarter
than they appear. They understand technology well enough to use it, and a
lizard firing an energy rifle while its rider shoots from its back is a sight
few forget.

They are psychic, and track by scent, by sight and by the lingering psychic
trail of their quarry. Only psychics earn their trust, and only a bonded Blood
Rider may ride one. The bond runs deeper than most friendships or family ties:
each partner will die for the other, and a lizard whose rider is murdered will
spend the rest of its life hunting down the killers.
', 'published', 'data-script'
